# Ashen Ossuary prototype one-handed sword.
# Units: centimeters. Pivot/origin is near the grip center for socket attachment.
# Forward blade direction: +X. Intended Unreal import scale: 1.0.

mtllib SM_AO_ProtoSword.mtl
o SM_AO_ProtoSword

